  "content": [
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Hotspur, reading a letter."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "\"But, for mine own part, my lord, I could be well contented to be there, in respect of the love I bear your house.\" He could be contented; why is he not, then? In respect of the love he bears our house—he shows in this, he loves his own barn better than he loves our house. Let me see some more. \"The purpose you undertake is dangerous\"—Why, that's certain. 'Tis dangerous to take a cold, to sleep, to drink; but I tell you, my lord fool, out of this nettle, danger, we pluck this flower, safety. \"The purpose you undertake is dangerous, the friends you have named uncertain, the time itself unsorted, and your whole plot too light for the counterpoise of so great an opposition.\" Say you so, say you so? I say unto you again, you are a shallow, cowardly hind, and you lie. What a lack-brain is this! By the Lord, our plot is a good plot as ever was laid, our friends true and constant: a good plot, good friends, and full of expectation; an excellent plot, very good friends. What a frosty-spirited rogue is this! Why, my Lord of York commends the plot and the general course of the action. Zounds, an I were now by this rascal, I could brain him with his lady's fan. Is there not my father, my uncle, and myself? Lord Edmund Mortimer, my Lord of York, and Owen Glendower? Is there not besides the Douglas? Have I not all their letters to meet me in arms by the ninth of the next month, and are they not some of them set forward already? What a pagan rascal is this, an infidel! Ha! You shall see now, in very sincerity of fear and cold heart, will he to the King, and lay open all our proceedings. O, I could divide myself, and go to buffets, for moving such a dish of skim milk with so honourable an action! Hang him, let him tell the King, we are prepared. I will set forward tonight.—",
          "plainText": "But for mine own part my lord I could be well contented to be there in respect of the love I bear your house He could be contented why is he not then In respect of the love he bears our househe shows in this he loves his own barn better than he loves our house Let me see some more The purpose you undertake is dangerousWhy that's certain 'Tis dangerous to take a cold to sleep to drink but I tell you my lord fool out of this nettle danger we pluck this flower safety The purpose you undertake is dangerous the friends you have named uncertain the time itself unsorted and your whole plot too light for the counterpoise of so great an opposition Say you so say you so I say unto you again you are a shallow cowardly hind and you lie What a lackbrain is this By the Lord our plot is a good plot as ever was laid our friends true and constant a good plot good friends and full of expectation an excellent plot very good friends What a frostyspirited rogue is this Why my Lord of York commends the plot and the general course of the action Zounds an I were now by this rascal I could brain him with his lady's fan Is there not my father my uncle and myself Lord Edmund Mortimer my Lord of York and Owen Glendower Is there not besides the Douglas Have I not all their letters to meet me in arms by the ninth of the next month and are they not some of them set forward already What a pagan rascal is this an infidel Ha You shall see now in very sincerity of fear and cold heart will he to the King and lay open all our proceedings O I could divide myself and go to buffets for moving such a dish of skim milk with so honourable an action Hang him let him tell the King we are prepared I will set forward tonight",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Lady Percy."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O my good lord, why are you thus alone?",
          "plainText": "O my good lord why are you thus alone",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "For what offence have I this fortnight been",
          "plainText": "For what offence have I this fortnight been",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "A banish'd woman from my Harry's bed?",
          "plainText": "A banish'd woman from my Harry's bed",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Tell me, sweet lord, what is't that takes from thee",
          "plainText": "Tell me sweet lord what is't that takes from thee",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Thy stomach, pleasure, and thy golden sleep?",
          "plainText": "Thy stomach pleasure and thy golden sleep",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Why dost thou bend thine eyes upon the earth,",
          "plainText": "Why dost thou bend thine eyes upon the earth",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "And start so often when thou sit'st alone?",
          "plainText": "And start so often when thou sit'st alone",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Why hast thou lost the fresh blood in thy cheeks,",
          "plainText": "Why hast thou lost the fresh blood in thy cheeks",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "And given my treasures and my rights of thee",
          "plainText": "And given my treasures and my rights of thee",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "To thick-eyed musing and curst melancholy?",
          "plainText": "To thickeyed musing and curst melancholy",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "In thy faint slumbers I by thee have watch'd,",
          "plainText": "In thy faint slumbers I by thee have watch'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "And heard thee murmur tales of iron wars,",
          "plainText": "And heard thee murmur tales of iron wars",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "Speak terms of manage to thy bounding steed,",
          "plainText": "Speak terms of manage to thy bounding steed",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "Cry \"Courage! To the field!\" And thou hast talk'd",
          "plainText": "Cry Courage To the field And thou hast talk'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "Of sallies and retires, of trenches, tents,",
          "plainText": "Of sallies and retires of trenches tents",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "Of palisadoes, frontiers, parapets,",
          "plainText": "Of palisadoes frontiers parapets",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "Of basilisks, of cannon, culverin,",
          "plainText": "Of basilisks of cannon culverin",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 18,
          "text": "Of prisoners' ransom, and of soldiers slain,",
          "plainText": "Of prisoners' ransom and of soldiers slain",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 19,
          "text": "And all the currents of a heady fight.",
          "plainText": "And all the currents of a heady fight",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 20,
          "text": "Thy spirit within thee hath been so at war,",
          "plainText": "Thy spirit within thee hath been so at war",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 21,
          "text": "And thus hath so bestirr'd thee in thy sleep,",
          "plainText": "And thus hath so bestirr'd thee in thy sleep",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 22,
          "text": "That beads of sweat have stood upon thy brow",
          "plainText": "That beads of sweat have stood upon thy brow",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 23,
          "text": "Like bubbles in a late-disturbed stream,",
          "plainText": "Like bubbles in a latedisturbed stream",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 24,
          "text": "And in thy face strange motions have appear'd,",
          "plainText": "And in thy face strange motions have appear'd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 25,
          "text": "Such as we see when men restrain their breath",
          "plainText": "Such as we see when men restrain their breath",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 26,
          "text": "On some great sudden hest. O, what portents are these?",
          "plainText": "On some great sudden hest O what portents are these",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 27,
          "text": "Some heavy business hath my lord in hand,",
          "plainText": "Some heavy business hath my lord in hand",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 28,
          "text": "And I must know it, else he loves me not.",
          "plainText": "And I must know it else he loves me not",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What, ho!",
          "plainText": "What ho",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter a Servant."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "servant",
        "name": "SERVANT",
        "displayName": "Servant"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He is, my lord, an hour ago.",
          "plainText": "He is my lord an hour ago",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Hath Butler brought those horses from the sheriff?",
          "plainText": "Hath Butler brought those horses from the sheriff",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "servant",
        "name": "SERVANT",
        "displayName": "Servant"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "One horse, my lord, he brought even now.",
          "plainText": "One horse my lord he brought even now",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What horse? A roan, a crop-ear, is it not?",
          "plainText": "What horse A roan a cropear is it not",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "servant",
        "name": "SERVANT",
        "displayName": "Servant"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "It is, my lord.",
          "plainText": "It is my lord",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "That roan shall be my throne.",
          "plainText": "That roan shall be my throne",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Well, I will back him straight. O Esperance!",
          "plainText": "Well I will back him straight O Esperance",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Bid Butler lead him forth into the park.",
          "plainText": "Bid Butler lead him forth into the park",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-stage-004",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit Servant.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "But hear you, my lord.",
          "plainText": "But hear you my lord",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What say'st thou, my lady?",
          "plainText": "What say'st thou my lady",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What is it carries you away?",
          "plainText": "What is it carries you away",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Why, my horse, my love, my horse.",
          "plainText": "Why my horse my love my horse",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Out, you mad-headed ape!",
          "plainText": "Out you madheaded ape",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "A weasel hath not such a deal of spleen",
          "plainText": "A weasel hath not such a deal of spleen",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "As you are toss'd with. In faith,",
          "plainText": "As you are toss'd with In faith",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "I'll know your business, Harry, that I will.",
          "plainText": "I'll know your business Harry that I will",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "I fear my brother Mortimer doth stir",
          "plainText": "I fear my brother Mortimer doth stir",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "About his title, and hath sent for you",
          "plainText": "About his title and hath sent for you",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "To line his enterprise. But if you go—",
          "plainText": "To line his enterprise But if you go",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "So far afoot, I shall be weary, love.",
          "plainText": "So far afoot I shall be weary love",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, come, you paraquito, answer me",
          "plainText": "Come come you paraquito answer me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Directly unto this question that I ask.",
          "plainText": "Directly unto this question that I ask",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "In faith, I'll break thy little finger, Harry,",
          "plainText": "In faith I'll break thy little finger Harry",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "If thou wilt not tell me all things true.",
          "plainText": "If thou wilt not tell me all things true",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Away,",
          "plainText": "Away",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Away, you trifler! Love, I love thee not,",
          "plainText": "Away you trifler Love I love thee not",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0057",
          "number": 57,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "I care not for thee, Kate. This is no world",
          "plainText": "I care not for thee Kate This is no world",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0058",
          "number": 58,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "To play with mammets and to tilt with lips.",
          "plainText": "To play with mammets and to tilt with lips",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0059",
          "number": 59,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "We must have bloody noses and crack'd crowns,",
          "plainText": "We must have bloody noses and crack'd crowns",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0060",
          "number": 60,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "And pass them current too.—Gods me, my horse!—",
          "plainText": "And pass them current tooGods me my horse",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0061",
          "number": 61,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "What say'st thou, Kate? What wouldst thou have with me?",
          "plainText": "What say'st thou Kate What wouldst thou have with me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-018",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0062",
          "number": 62,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Do you not love me? Do you not indeed?",
          "plainText": "Do you not love me Do you not indeed",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0063",
          "number": 63,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Well, do not, then, for since you love me not,",
          "plainText": "Well do not then for since you love me not",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0064",
          "number": 64,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "I will not love myself. Do you not love me?",
          "plainText": "I will not love myself Do you not love me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0065",
          "number": 65,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Nay, tell me if you speak in jest or no.",
          "plainText": "Nay tell me if you speak in jest or no",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-019",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0066",
          "number": 66,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, wilt thou see me ride?",
          "plainText": "Come wilt thou see me ride",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0067",
          "number": 67,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "And when I am a-horseback I will swear",
          "plainText": "And when I am ahorseback I will swear",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0068",
          "number": 68,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "I love thee infinitely. But hark you, Kate,",
          "plainText": "I love thee infinitely But hark you Kate",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0069",
          "number": 69,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "I must not have you henceforth question me",
          "plainText": "I must not have you henceforth question me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0070",
          "number": 70,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Whither I go, nor reason whereabout.",
          "plainText": "Whither I go nor reason whereabout",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0071",
          "number": 71,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Whither I must, I must; and, to conclude,",
          "plainText": "Whither I must I must and to conclude",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0072",
          "number": 72,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "This evening must I leave you, gentle Kate.",
          "plainText": "This evening must I leave you gentle Kate",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0073",
          "number": 73,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "I know you wise, but yet no farther wise",
          "plainText": "I know you wise but yet no farther wise",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0074",
          "number": 74,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Than Harry Percy's wife; constant you are,",
          "plainText": "Than Harry Percy's wife constant you are",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0075",
          "number": 75,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "But yet a woman; and for secrecy,",
          "plainText": "But yet a woman and for secrecy",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0076",
          "number": 76,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "No lady closer, for I well believe",
          "plainText": "No lady closer for I well believe",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0077",
          "number": 77,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "Thou wilt not utter what thou dost not know;",
          "plainText": "Thou wilt not utter what thou dost not know",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0078",
          "number": 78,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "And so far will I trust thee, gentle Kate.",
          "plainText": "And so far will I trust thee gentle Kate",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-020",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0079",
          "number": 79,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How? So far?",
          "plainText": "How So far",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-021",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hotspur",
        "name": "HOTSPUR",
        "displayName": "Hotspur"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0080",
          "number": 80,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Not an inch further. But hark you, Kate,",
          "plainText": "Not an inch further But hark you Kate",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0081",
          "number": 81,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Whither I go, thither shall you go too.",
          "plainText": "Whither I go thither shall you go too",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0082",
          "number": 82,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Today will I set forth, tomorrow you.",
          "plainText": "Today will I set forth tomorrow you",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0083",
          "number": 83,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Will this content you, Kate?",
          "plainText": "Will this content you Kate",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-speech-022",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lady-percy",
        "name": "LADY PERCY",
        "displayName": "Lady Percy"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-line-0084",
          "number": 84,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "It must, of force.",
          "plainText": "It must of force",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-2-3-stage-005",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}